{"bookId":"3john","version":"kjv-strong","source":"eBible KJV2006 USFM","chapters":{"1":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"The elder unto the wellbeloved Gaius, whom I love in the truth.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"elder","strongs":["G4245"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"wellbeloved","strongs":["G0027"]},{"text":"Gaius","strongs":["G1050"]},{"text":","},{"text":"whom","strongs":["G3739"]},{"text":"I","strongs":["G1473"]},{"text":"love","strongs":["G0025"]},{"text":"in","strongs":["G1722"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"truth","strongs":["G0225"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":2,"text":"Beloved, I wish above all things that thou mayest prosper and be in health, even as thy soul prospereth.","tokens":[{"text":"Beloved","strongs":["G0027"]},{"text":", I"},{"text":"wish","strongs":["G2172"]},{"text":"above","strongs":["G4012"]},{"text":"all"},{"text":"things","strongs":["G3956"]},{"text":"that","strongs":["G2137"]},{"text":"thou","strongs":["G4571"]},{"text":"mayest"},{"text":"prosper","strongs":["G2137"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"be in"},{"text":"health","strongs":["G5198"]},{"text":", even"},{"text":"as","strongs":["G2531"]},{"text":"thy","strongs":["G4675"]},{"text":"soul","strongs":["G5590"]},{"text":"prospereth","strongs":["G2137"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"For I rejoiced greatly, when the brethren came and testified of the truth that is in thee, even as thou walkest in the truth.","tokens":[{"text":"For","strongs":["G1063"]},{"text":"I"},{"text":"rejoiced","strongs":["G5463"]},{"text":"greatly","strongs":["G3029"]},{"text":", when the"},{"text":"brethren","strongs":["G0080"]},{"text":"came","strongs":["G2064"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"testified"},{"text":"of","strongs":["G3140"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"truth","strongs":["G0225"]},{"text":"that is in"},{"text":"thee","strongs":["G4675"]},{"text":", even"},{"text":"as","strongs":["G2531"]},{"text":"thou","strongs":["G4771"]},{"text":"walkest","strongs":["G4043"]},{"text":"in","strongs":["G1722"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"truth","strongs":["G0225"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"I have no greater joy than to hear that my children walk in truth.","tokens":[{"text":"I"},{"text":"have","strongs":["G2192"]},{"text":"no","strongs":["G3756"]},{"text":"greater","strongs":["G3186"]},{"text":"joy","strongs":["G5479"]},{"text":"than","strongs":["G2443"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"hear","strongs":["G0191"]},{"text":"that"},{"text":"my","strongs":["G1699"]},{"text":"children","strongs":["G5043"]},{"text":"walk","strongs":["G4043"]},{"text":"in","strongs":["G1722"]},{"text":"truth","strongs":["G0225"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"Beloved, thou doest faithfully whatsoever thou doest to the brethren, and to strangers;","tokens":[{"text":"Beloved","strongs":["G0027"]},{"text":", thou"},{"text":"doest","strongs":["G4160"]},{"text":"faithfully","strongs":["G4103"]},{"text":"whatsoever","strongs":["G3739"]},{"text":"thou"},{"text":"doest","strongs":["G2038"]},{"text":"to","strongs":["G1519"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"brethren","strongs":["G0080"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"to","strongs":["G1519"]},{"text":"strangers","strongs":["G3581"]},{"text":";"}]},{"number":6,"text":"Which have borne witness of thy charity before the church: whom if thou bring forward on their journey after a godly sort, thou shalt do well:","tokens":[{"text":"Which","strongs":["G3739"]},{"text":"have borne"},{"text":"witness","strongs":["G3140"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"thy","strongs":["G4675"]},{"text":"charity","strongs":["G0026"]},{"text":"before","strongs":["G1799"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"church","strongs":["G1577"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"whom","strongs":["G3739"]},{"text":"if thou bring forward on their"},{"text":"journey","strongs":["G4311"]},{"text":"after","strongs":["G0516"]},{"text":"a godly"},{"text":"sort","strongs":["G2316"]},{"text":", thou shalt"},{"text":"do","strongs":["G4160"]},{"text":"well","strongs":["G2573"]},{"text":":"}]},{"number":7,"text":"Because that for his name’s sake they went forth, taking nothing of the Gentiles.","tokens":[{"text":"Because"},{"text":"that","strongs":["G1063"]},{"text":"for","strongs":["G5228"]},{"text":"his","strongs":["G0846"]},{"text":"name’s sake","strongs":["G3686"]},{"text":"they went"},{"text":"forth","strongs":["G1831"]},{"text":","},{"text":"taking","strongs":["G2983"]},{"text":"nothing","strongs":["G3367"]},{"text":"of","strongs":["G0575"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"Gentiles","strongs":["G1484"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"We therefore ought to receive such, that we might be fellowhelpers to the truth.","tokens":[{"text":"We","strongs":["G2249"]},{"text":"therefore","strongs":["G3767"]},{"text":"ought","strongs":["G3784"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"receive","strongs":["G0618"]},{"text":"such","strongs":["G5108"]},{"text":","},{"text":"that","strongs":["G2443"]},{"text":"we might"},{"text":"be","strongs":["G1096"]},{"text":"fellowhelpers","strongs":["G4904"]},{"text":"to the"},{"text":"truth","strongs":["G0225"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"I wrote unto the church: but Diotrephes, who loveth to have the preeminence among them, receiveth us not.","tokens":[{"text":"I wrote"},{"text":"unto","strongs":["G1125"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"church","strongs":["G1577"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"but","strongs":["G0235"]},{"text":"Diotrephes","strongs":["G1361"]},{"text":", who loveth to have the"},{"text":"preeminence","strongs":["G5383"]},{"text":"among"},{"text":"them","strongs":["G0846"]},{"text":","},{"text":"receiveth","strongs":["G1926"]},{"text":"us","strongs":["G2248"]},{"text":"not","strongs":["G3756"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"Wherefore, if I come, I will remember his deeds which he doeth, prating against us with malicious words: and not content therewith, neither doth he himself receive the brethren, and forbiddeth them that would, and casteth them out of the church.","tokens":[{"text":"Wherefore","strongs":["G5124"]},{"text":","},{"text":"if","strongs":["G1437"]},{"text":"I"},{"text":"come","strongs":["G2064"]},{"text":", I will"},{"text":"remember","strongs":["G5279"]},{"text":"his","strongs":["G0846"]},{"text":"deeds","strongs":["G2041"]},{"text":"which","strongs":["G3739"]},{"text":"he"},{"text":"doeth","strongs":["G4160"]},{"text":", prating"},{"text":"against","strongs":["G5396"]},{"text":"us","strongs":["G2248"]},{"text":"with","strongs":["G3056"]},{"text":"malicious","strongs":["G4190"]},{"text":"words","strongs":["G3056"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"not","strongs":["G3361"]},{"text":"content","strongs":["G0714"]},{"text":"therewith","strongs":["G5125"]},{"text":","},{"text":"neither","strongs":["G3777"]},{"text":"doth","strongs":["G1926"]},{"text":"he"},{"text":"himself","strongs":["G0846"]},{"text":"receive","strongs":["G1926"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"brethren","strongs":["G0080"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"forbiddeth","strongs":["G2967"]},{"text":"them that"},{"text":"would","strongs":["G1014"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"casteth","strongs":["G1544"]},{"text":"them out"},{"text":"of","strongs":["G1537"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"church","strongs":["G1577"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":11,"text":"Beloved, follow not that which is evil, but that which is good. He that doeth good is of God: but he that doeth evil hath not seen God.","tokens":[{"text":"Beloved","strongs":["G0027"]},{"text":","},{"text":"follow","strongs":["G3401"]},{"text":"not","strongs":["G3361"]},{"text":"that which"},{"text":"is","strongs":["G3588"]},{"text":"evil","strongs":["G2556"]},{"text":","},{"text":"but","strongs":["G0235"]},{"text":"that which"},{"text":"is","strongs":["G3588"]},{"text":"good","strongs":["G0018"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"He","strongs":["G3588"]},{"text":"that doeth"},{"text":"good","strongs":["G0015"]},{"text":"is","strongs":["G2076"]},{"text":"of","strongs":["G1537"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["G2316"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"but","strongs":["G1161"]},{"text":"he","strongs":["G3588"]},{"text":"that doeth"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["G2554"]},{"text":"hath","strongs":["G3708"]},{"text":"not","strongs":["G3756"]},{"text":"seen","strongs":["G3708"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["G2316"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"Demetrius hath good report of all men, and of the truth itself: yea, and we also bear record; and ye know that our record is true.","tokens":[{"text":"Demetrius","strongs":["G1216"]},{"text":"hath good"},{"text":"report","strongs":["G3140"]},{"text":"of","strongs":["G5259"]},{"text":"all","strongs":["G3956"]},{"text":"men,"},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"of","strongs":["G5259"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"truth","strongs":["G0225"]},{"text":"itself","strongs":["G0846"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"yea","strongs":["G1161"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"we","strongs":["G2249"]},{"text":"also bear"},{"text":"record","strongs":["G3140"]},{"text":";"},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"ye"},{"text":"know","strongs":["G1492"]},{"text":"that","strongs":["G3754"]},{"text":"our","strongs":["G2257"]},{"text":"record","strongs":["G3141"]},{"text":"is","strongs":["G2076"]},{"text":"true","strongs":["G0227"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"I had many things to write, but I will not with ink and pen write unto thee:","tokens":[{"text":"I"},{"text":"had","strongs":["G2192"]},{"text":"many"},{"text":"things","strongs":["G4183"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"write","strongs":["G1125"]},{"text":","},{"text":"but","strongs":["G0235"]},{"text":"I"},{"text":"will","strongs":["G2309"]},{"text":"not","strongs":["G3756"]},{"text":"with","strongs":["G1223"]},{"text":"ink","strongs":["G3188"]},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"pen","strongs":["G2563"]},{"text":"write","strongs":["G1125"]},{"text":"unto"},{"text":"thee","strongs":["G4671"]},{"text":":"}]},{"number":14,"text":"But I trust I shall shortly see thee, and we shall speak face to face. Peace be to thee. Our friends salute thee. Greet the friends by name.","tokens":[{"text":"But","strongs":["G1161"]},{"text":"I"},{"text":"trust","strongs":["G1679"]},{"text":"I"},{"text":"shall","strongs":["G1492"]},{"text":"shortly","strongs":["G2112"]},{"text":"see","strongs":["G1492"]},{"text":"thee","strongs":["G4571"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and","strongs":["G2532"]},{"text":"we shall"},{"text":"speak","strongs":["G2980"]},{"text":"face","strongs":["G4750"]},{"text":"to","strongs":["G4314"]},{"text":"face","strongs":["G4750"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Peace","strongs":["G1515"]},{"text":"be to"},{"text":"thee","strongs":["G4671"]},{"text":". Our"},{"text":"friends","strongs":["G5384"]},{"text":"salute","strongs":["G0782"]},{"text":"thee","strongs":["G4571"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Greet","strongs":["G0782"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"friends","strongs":["G5384"]},{"text":"by","strongs":["G2596"]},{"text":"name","strongs":["G3686"]},{"text":"."}]}]}}}